#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:1 35d0d41efb714b0da3d8794c07d5678f
msgid "案例分析"
msgstr "Case analysis"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:3 54b78b373dfb4fee8e12d484a40a2b9b
msgid "对训练好的模型进行案例分析——查看单个学生的答题序列和知识状态变化。"
msgstr "Perform case analysis on a trained model — inspect an individual student's response sequence and the evolution of their knowledge state."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:5 a62f2fe54b174a419ca199ae676ae616
msgid "概述"
msgstr "Overview"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:7 603ef0c8f6f544c0a53e2112c0f8e6bd
msgid ""
"案例分析的目的是**可视化模型对具体学生的预测质量**：模型在哪里对了、哪里错了、知识状态如何演变。 它通过三步工作流完成：推理 → 筛选学生 →"
" 生成热力图。"
msgstr ""
"The goal of case analysis is to **visualize the prediction quality for "
"specific students**: where the model was right, where it was wrong, and "
"how the knowledge state evolves. It follows a three-step workflow: "
"inference → student selection → heatmap generation."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:15 8d20b81a64e54347b27205c6cfb3d56d
msgid "快速上手"
msgstr "Quick start"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:34 9edec3ff5ee44fa5b44ffb9d3f5100a2
msgid ""
"三步必须按顺序执行——``select`` 依赖 ``inference`` 产出的 "
"``predictions.parquet``，``plot`` 依赖 ``select`` 产出的 "
"``selected_users.json``。"
msgstr ""
"The three steps must be executed in order — ``select`` depends on the "
"``predictions.parquet`` produced by ``inference``, and ``plot`` depends "
"on the ``selected_users.json`` produced by ``select``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:41 95dd125ef8c54d88b1211dbc9d3890e3
msgid "inference —— 批量推理"
msgstr "inference — Batch inference"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:43 1093bf1c4dc142b79ac00c7c17698f37
msgid "加载 ``best_model.pth``，用验证集跑前向推理，保存预测结果。"
msgstr "Loads ``best_model.pth``, runs forward inference on the validation set, and saves the predictions."

