"(run ``case_analysis.py inference --help`` for the full reference)."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:56 38a398f36d98450f97946a3741d4b5fe
msgid ""
"执行流程：从 ``run_config.yaml`` 归档恢复 ``RunConfig``（CLI flag 覆盖其上）→ 加载模型专属的 "
"``CaseAnalyzer`` → 遍历验证集批量推理 → 输出 parquet 文件。"
msgstr ""
"Execution flow: restore the ``RunConfig`` from the ``run_config.yaml`` "
"archive (CLI flags override it) → load the model-specific "
"``CaseAnalyzer`` → iterate over the validation set for batch inference → "
"output a parquet file."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:58 cb1e43d1136c459589a6ccbff7738d8b
msgid "推理完成后在 ``run_dir/case_analysis/`` 下生成："
msgstr "After inference, the following are generated under ``run_dir/case_analysis/``:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:67 224d4a8faca54b1097b756fef844ecbf
msgid ""
"``CaseAnalyzer`` 继承 "
"``BaseCaseAnalyzer``（``utils/case_analysis/base_analyzer.py``），只加载 "
"checkpoint 不创建 optimizer/loss——专为推理设计。如果 run 目录下没有 "
"``run_config.yaml``，命令会在解析阶段直接报错。"
msgstr ""
"``CaseAnalyzer`` inherits from ``BaseCaseAnalyzer`` "
"(``utils/case_analysis/base_analyzer.py``), loading only the checkpoint "
"without creating an optimizer/loss — it is purpose-built for inference. "
"If the run directory has no ``run_config.yaml``, the command fails at "
"parse time."

