#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:87 2949d61f691d411d9499e40b3af1195f
msgid ""
"默认值在 CLI 层显式声明（与内置 selector 的 ``select`` 签名默认值保持一致）；修改插件默认值不会隐式改变 CLI "
"行为。自定义 selector 需遵循 ``UserSelector`` 接口，接受上述同名的关键字参数。"
msgstr ""
"Defaults are declared explicitly at the CLI layer (aligned with the "
"built-in selectors' ``select`` signature defaults); changing a plugin's "
"Python default does not silently change CLI behaviour. Custom selectors "
"must follow the ``UserSelector`` interface and accept these keyword "
"arguments."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:90 1e2080deef7d451497de5c8ae839f4b3
msgid "三种策略"
msgstr "The three strategies"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:92 2ccfa3ca3b5c45549e0c0ecf33d50092
msgid ""
"**diverse（多样采样，默认）**：将学生按错误率分 5 个桶（very_low → "
"very_high），从每个桶均匀采样，覆盖不同能力层次。"
msgstr ""
"**diverse (diverse sampling, default)**: splits students into 5 buckets "
"by error rate (very_low → very_high), sampling evenly from each bucket to"
" cover different ability levels."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:100
#: 152cc35bbbeb41f69f5464162d1e00ff
msgid "**extreme（极端案例）**：选择错误率最高的学生，适合分析模型失败模式。"
msgstr "**extreme (edge cases)**: selects the students with the highest error rates, useful for analyzing model failure modes."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:108
#: b3d5e4f5d1704ffe89248d8ef08c2c10
msgid "**random（随机采样）**：从符合条件的候选中随机抽取，适合快速抽查。"
msgstr "**random (random sampling)**: randomly samples from qualifying candidates, useful for quick checks."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:116
#: fe9e25ede00a49ba8a0ae1858229221d
msgid "筛选逻辑"
msgstr "Selection logic"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:118
#: 680f23edf6bf4d85b583b77867764cc5
msgid "计算所有学生的 ``num_attempts`` / ``error_rate`` / ``avg_confidence``"
msgstr "Compute ``num_attempts`` / ``error_rate`` / ``avg_confidence`` for every student"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:119
#: 71bffedf12f64c45b8405c33bf46239b
msgid ""
"过滤掉 ``num_attempts < min_seq_len``、``error_rate`` 不在 ``[min_error, "
"max_error]`` 或 ``avg_confidence`` 不在 ``[min_confidence, max_confidence]``"
" 的学生"
msgstr ""
"Filter out students with ``num_attempts < min_seq_len``, an "
"``error_rate`` outside ``[min_error, max_error]``, or an "
"``avg_confidence`` outside ``[min_confidence, max_confidence]``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:120
#: f3381e72d361425699eaf8a4c80270c3
msgid "符合条件不足 ``num_users`` 则全部返回，否则按策略采样"
msgstr "Return all matches when fewer than ``num_users`` qualify; otherwise sample by strategy"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:122
#: 61e50a2b875544e29db8f5bdc93b08f8
msgid "结果保存到 ``run_dir/case_analysis/<selector>/selected_users.json``。"
msgstr "Results are saved to ``run_dir/case_analysis/<selector>/selected_users.json``."

