#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:231
#: f117f60cbd0847c79243d94121b50573
msgid "已有 34 个模型中的大部分实现了该方法。新模型参考 ``model/DKT/DKT_analyzer.py`` 创建即可。"
msgstr "Most of the 34 existing models implement this method. For a new model, follow ``model/DKT/DKT_analyzer.py``."

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:234
#: 77836da61b264d20b6c075f2115cace0
msgid "最佳实践"
msgstr "Best practices"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:236
#: 82309abc4b0e4b1faf0f4c8206413e56
msgid "**先看 extreme**：找到模型表现最差的学生，优先修复失败模式"
msgstr "**Look at extreme first**: find the students where the model performs worst and fix failure modes first"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:237
#: e698309a803645a687077837e5e30fb1
msgid "**再看 diverse**：覆盖不同能力层次，确认修复没有引入退化"
msgstr "**Then diverse**: cover different ability levels and confirm the fix introduced no regression"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:238
#: 4f5157417b29413ea811e42203860a77
msgid "**对比不同模型**：同一数据集、同一学生，对比两个模型的热力图"
msgstr "**Compare models**: same dataset, same student, compare two models' heatmaps"

#: ../../source/user-guide/case-analysis.md:239
#: 927ff39227d243318295859f840d09ef
msgid "**截断长序列**：答题数超过 100 时用 ``--case.max_seq_len 100``，避免热力图过宽"
msgstr "**Truncate long sequences**: use ``--case.max_seq_len 100`` beyond 100 attempts to keep heatmaps readable"

